OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with isolated
OL,6,Fshowers through the morning. Becoming
OL,7,Fdry for most as cloud breaks through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Breezy, particularly
OL,9,Faround the coast and over hills, with
OL,10,Fnear average temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPartly cloudy this evening
OL,13,Fwith some clear spells, though cloud
OL,14,Fincreasing overnight. Largely dry
OL,15,Fthrough the evening, but showers
OL,16,Fdeveloping through the early hours.
OL,17,FChilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
